<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="04">
<name>Driveline/Axle</name>
<section id="1000K_S0015" variety="S0015">
<name>Differential</name>
<ttl id="1000K_S0015_744ZW_T00A7" variety="T00A7">
<name>Active Torque Control 4WD System</name>
<para id="RM00000068H00EX" category="C" type-id="3052N" name-id="370EC-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1241/94</dtccode>
<dtcname>Power Source Voltage Drop Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000068H00EX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00005J100000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>When a malfunction occurs in the power supply circuit, or when a communication malfunction occurs between the skid control computer and the 4WD computer assembly, the 4WD computer assembly detects a power supply voltage drop malfunction.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1241/94</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>With a vehicle speed of 3km/h or more, the IG1 terminal voltage remains at 9.5V or less for 10 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>With the IG1 terminal voltage at 9.5V or less, data cannot be received from the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly (skid control computer) for 60 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>With the IG1 terminal voltage at 17V or more, data cannot be received from the skid control computer for 3 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Battery</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ECU-IG1 Fuse</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire harness and connector (IG1 terminal circuit, GND terminal circuit)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Alternator</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>4WD Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly (Skid Control Computer)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000068H00EX_03" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00005J200000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C163017J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000068H00EX_05" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000068H00EX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00005J300000">
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the ignition switch ON and, following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, read the DTCs of the ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA system.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA system procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000060000PX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check if any speed sensor malfunction codes (C0200/31, C0205/32, C0210/33, C0215/34, C1235/35, C1236/36, C1238/38, C1239/39) of the ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA system are output in addition to DTC C1241/94.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Speed sensor malfunction codes are not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Speed sensor malfunction codes are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0003" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0006" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00005J400000">
<testtitle>Inspect Battery</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the battery voltage.</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0004" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___00005J500000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (ECU-IG1)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance of the ECU-IG1 fuse.</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>1 Ω or less</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0005" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0008" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00005J600000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Power Source Circuit)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the 4WD computer assembly connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C117072J10" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the vehicle side connector terminal of the 4WD computer assembly and body ground. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000068800EX"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.88in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 (IG1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0011" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0012" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0011" proc-id="RM0550J___00005J700000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Ground Circuit)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the wire harness side connector terminal of the 4WD computer assembly and body ground. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000068800EX"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C117072J11" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.88in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>23 (GND) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0009" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000068H00EX_04_0010" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0006">
<testtitle>Go to Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005ZT00PX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0007">
<testtitle>Inspect and replace battery or charging system</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0008">
<testtitle>Replace Fuse</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0012">
<testtitle>Inspect Power Supply Circuit</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0009">
<testtitle>Replace 4WD computer assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002WLE001X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000068H00EX_04_0010">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness and Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
